      "Campbell and Heinz (1991), primary abstract: B2/B1 V0 ratio, K0, fixed K0', and 2-56 GPa range",
      "Dewaele et al. (2012), Table III: experimental B1-KCl V0"
     ],
     "finding": "This is an explicit two-primary-source composite. Campbell and Heinz report V0(B2)/V0(B1)=0.8483+/-0.0057, K0=28.7+/-0.6 GPa, and K0'=4 fixed. Multiplication by Dewaele et al.'s B1 V0=62.36 A^3/formula unit gives V0(B2)=52.899988 A^3. Because Dewaele et al. publish no V0 error, only the Campbell ratio error is propagated.",
     "doi": "10.1016/0022-3697(91)90181-x"
    },
